<title>POLAND: WBK bank unit gets PLN 55 mln loan.</title>
<headline>WBK bank unit gets PLN 55 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish  Gliwicki Bank Handlowy SA (GBH), 87 percent owned by Wielkopolski Bank Kredytowy SA (WBK), received a 55 million zloty, seven year loan from the Banking Guarantee Fund, WBK said in a Wednesday statement.</p>
<p>WBK said it guaranteed the loan, with which GBH will buy treasury and NBP bills.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
